      "problem": "Find $|r(1)|$ given that $r(t)=⟨8{t}^{2}-5,\\,2t+2,\\,5t⟩.$",
      "worked_solution": "Evaluating the function at $t=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(1) & =⟨8({1}^{2})-5,\\,2(1)+2,\\,5(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,4,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(1)| & =\\sqrt{{(3)}^{2}+{(4)}^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{50} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
